    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-opinions-reporting-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express thoughts and report speech",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "觉得 presents a personal impression or view. 认为 states a view or judgment; 以为 often introduces an assumption later corrected. Report the belief in ordinary clause order, without copying English tense backshifts or treating every reported belief as a fact.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我觉得这本书很好。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ juéde zhè běn shū hěn hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "I think this book is good.",
                "audio": "9d755a9f213077d1c90565d78411c4f312937ff1df29ec3637ca7966e0ed88a2"
              },
              {
                "text": "我认为明天有课。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ rènwéi míngtiān yǒu kè 。",
                "meaning": "I believe there is class tomorrow.",
                "audio": "721ea91f95ca6615db25fb3640cb7b40a2cfdce7ec24e402f9c0152273ba4662"
              },
              {
                "text": "我以为没有课，是我想错了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǐwéi méiyǒu kè ， shì wǒ xiǎng cuò le 。",
                "meaning": "I thought there was no class, but I was mistaken.",
                "audio": "ddb38c2849f3344e824837c5a3a51af6e3df521e1e7e50da1d4959295cae871f"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
